; Absence: a request is served only while (busy) is absent, and a racing
; rule makes (busy). Adding a row disables a firing, which rho's reduction
; cannot (ConsensusNumbers.rho_cannot_encode_absence; RhoCalculus/Weaknesses:
; rho_no_encoding_of_disableable; ReflectiveCalculus/Encodings/Strict:
; strict_separation). Two outcomes: served, or blocked for good.
(step one)
(req)
(go)
(rule serve (take (req)) (absent (busy)) (make (served)))
(rule block (take (go)) (make (busy)))
